    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a high-tech future among Jupiter\u2019s moons, the story follows Ryla, Grant, and Jun\u2014a misfit trio from vastly different corners of the solar system. After an unexpected twist of fate leaves them broke and stuck with a run-down spaceship salvage yard, they\u2019ll have to work through their differences and pool their skills to turn Jupiter Junkworks into something worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll uncover secrets about their pasts, their motivations, and maybe even why the junkyard\u2019s last owner vanished without a trace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/c3bf9a30df7fbcee6376db75c3b78a91.avif?t=1753079918\" width=620 height=140 /></span>Fast, strategic, and satisfyingly crunchy\u2014Jupiter Junkworks brings classic arcade puzzle vibes with a fresh sci-fi twist. Complete contracts to earn resources and unlock upgrades in both gameplay and story. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slamming blocks is at the heart of Jupiter Junkworks\u2019 arcade puzzle action. Every slam lets you shear off parts of existing blocks or compress gaps beneath them\u2014essential techniques you\u2019ll need to master to succeed. It\u2019s also how you recharge your power-ups, so keep slamming and keep the momentum going! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/5670bc8912f17a889a14830d8eeae4e9.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/5670bc8912f17a889a14830d8eeae4e9.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/5670bc8912f17a889a14830d8eeae4e9.mp4?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MATCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match colored bits to collect valuable resources and trigger block tumbles! In many challenges, collecting these bits is your primary objective\u2014often more important than simply clearing rows. They also carry over into the campaign, so going above and beyond your contract goals means extra resources to invest in upgrades and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/1f25066dbcb58f2854a375198328679b.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/1f25066dbcb58f2854a375198328679b.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/1f25066dbcb58f2854a375198328679b.mp4?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRUSH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement and timing are key, as building massive rows and chaining combos together will earn you greater rewards and help you complete contracts faster. But there\u2019s a twist: every crushed row fuels your heat meter, gradually ramping up the pace and intensity. As your heat rises, so does the speed of incoming blocks, pushing your reflexes and decision-making to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/82fb84313d84d6f620ddf9a7a27b8378.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/82fb84313d84d6f620ddf9a7a27b8378.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/82fb84313d84d6f620ddf9a7a27b8378.mp4?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SMASH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a growing arsenal of tools designed to obliterate blocks and boost your strategy. One of the first at your disposal is the Rail Driver which compresses everything in a block-wide column, clearing space and setting up massive plays. Each powerup can be used to create a unique loadout tailored to your playstyle, whether you prefer calculated combos, brute force, or chaos-fueled improvisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/87baacb66b0841c593b436ccd5c0ecdf.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/87baacb66b0841c593b436ccd5c0ecdf.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/87baacb66b0841c593b436ccd5c0ecdf.mp4?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ea0e108d3092ef10b2160d237bd0e087.avif?t=1753079918\" width=620 height=140 /></span>Join Ryla, Grant, and Jun as they band together to make the most of their unexpected new life at Jupiter Junkworks. Hailing from wildly different corners of the solar system\u2014a Mars orbital workyard, Earth\u2019s sprawling megacities, and a commercial pilot training fleet\u2014they\u2019ll need to overcome their differences to have any hope of success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your team grows closer, so does the mystery behind Jupiter Junkworks. What really happened to the last owner? And what will you do when you finally uncover the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ce3de2a94bb68c8dcaf4ae9e40b51323.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ce3de2a94bb68c8dcaf4ae9e40b51323.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ce3de2a94bb68c8dcaf4ae9e40b51323.mp4?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a high-tech future among Jupiter\u2019s moons, the story follows Ryla, Grant, and Jun\u2014a misfit trio from vastly different corners of the solar system. After an unexpected twist of fate leaves them broke and stuck with a run-down spaceship salvage yard, they\u2019ll have to work through their differences and pool their skills to turn Jupiter Junkworks into something worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll uncover secrets about their pasts, their motivations, and maybe even why the junkyard\u2019s last owner vanished without a trace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/c3bf9a30df7fbcee6376db75c3b78a91.avif?t=1753079918\" width=620 height=140 /></span>Fast, strategic, and satisfyingly crunchy\u2014Jupiter Junkworks brings classic arcade puzzle vibes with a fresh sci-fi twist. Complete contracts to earn resources and unlock upgrades in both gameplay and story. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slamming blocks is at the heart of Jupiter Junkworks\u2019 arcade puzzle action. Every slam lets you shear off parts of existing blocks or compress gaps beneath them\u2014essential techniques you\u2019ll need to master to succeed. It\u2019s also how you recharge your power-ups, so keep slamming and keep the momentum going! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/5670bc8912f17a889a14830d8eeae4e9.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/5670bc8912f17a889a14830d8eeae4e9.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar