et\u2014they\u2019ll need to overcome their differences to have any hope of success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your team grows closer, so does the mystery behind Jupiter Junkworks. What really happened to the last owner? And what will you do when you finally uncover the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ce3de2a94bb68c8dcaf4ae9e40b51323.poster.avif?t=1753079918\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ce3de2a94bb68c8dcaf4ae9e40b51323.webm?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913540/extras/ce3de2a94bb68c8dcaf4ae9e40b51323.mp4?t=1753079918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
